<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NTT raised by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NTT raised by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its ratings of Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp on Wednesday. The stock was upgraded to a near-term buy from a near-term accumulate and to a long-term accumulate from a long-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 36-1/2 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
